{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What...?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wasn't he-..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is doing a Guardian of that land",
                "around Gensokyo?!"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Greeting, Lady Reimu."
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've been looking for you."
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh? For me?"
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why you were looking for me, Xaero?"
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nothing so much special at all~."
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just doing a simple favor~."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's from our dear afiliate, Caty Yafumo."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She wants to see you. It's a little important."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y' know, she likes to have some",
                "talk with you sometimes."
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I..."
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh... This encounter...",
                "Just exactly at <b$this> moment..."
            ]
        },
        "236_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It can't be so much coincidence...!",
                "My intuition feels it!"
            ]
        },
        "244_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are the Guardians behind this!?"
            ]
        },
        "252_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whoa-... Hey-. Calm down"
            ]
        },
        "260_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't even know what are you talking about!"
            ]
        },
        "268_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you dare to raise your weapon...",
                "I will not hesitate to defend myself!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Time out."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was <b$REALLY> unnecesary..."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We don't fight for no reason."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We fight for self-defense, training,",
                "power testing or an arranged event."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But not so lightly."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fine, I just forgot your manners are",
                "not like as in Gensokyo..."
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then the guardians aren't in something bad, are they?"
            ]
        },
        "86_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems my intuition isn't working well these times..."
            ]
        },
        "94_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway. Tell Yafumo I will go with",
                "her after something important."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No problem."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way. I noticed you have a",
                "devilish power with you~."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What a nice gesture from you."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh that thing, yeah..."
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought it could be useful this time..."
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I should hurry now."
            ]
        }
    }
